{"4515540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Error: Love - Human Bug Eradication Project", "steam_appid": 4515540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Setting]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If love is an error you can’t fix… will you delete me—or keep me?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven experience blending Visual Novel storytelling with Censorship Simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a &quot;Censor&quot; within the rational society of &quot;The Polis,&quot; your role is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the &quot;Rules.&quot; Identify the Bugs. Eliminate errors in human behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath this precision-engineered world, one question remains—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >how much are you willing to sacrifice for order?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Genre]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven Visual Novel with light Censorship Simulation mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative Choice</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the story through your decisions and uncover multiple paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Censorship Simulation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consult the rulebook and determine whether each footage is &quot;Normal&quot; or &quot;Abnormal.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form deep connections with characters—and unlock multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, what will you choose to protect?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Setting]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If love is an error you can’t fix… will you delete me—or 